OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-fire councillor facing 'no
OL,4,Aconfidence' vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Worcestershire councillor is facing a
OL,7,Fvote of no confidence - in what is
OL,8,Fbelieved to be a first in the
OL,9,Fauthority's 421-year history.
OL,11,FEmma Nishigaki will face the vote in a
OL,12,Fmeeting at Evesham Town Council on
OL,13,FMonday evening, amid a series of
OL,14,Fgrievances over her conduct.
OL,16,FIt follows a formal request from
OL,17,FWychavon district councillor, Craig
OL,18,FReeves, who has submitted a public
OL,19,Fpetition signed by almost 750 people.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
